es it's not a good thing to have our  South Korean allies be totally shocked  and sort of spun up into bewilderment by  an announcement like this it's important  to keep them on board to talk to the  Japanese talk to talk to others that  need to be supporting what we're doing  in these talks in the end does the Dear  Leader walk away from the table well the  thing is that one thing we have to  understand is what these nuclear weapons  mean to kim jeong-hoon and they are  literally tied to his actual physical  survival so I think that again we have  to understand this is not you know the  president keeps saying well we could  bring you economic prosperity and we  could guarantee your safety  Kim jong-un knows he's got a guarantee  of his personal safety and those are  those nuclear weapons charlie briefly do  you expect a result yeah I do think that  they will it may not be on the date that  they predicted but I do predict that  there will be some kind of meeting

